      "content": "..; collection Paul Nijhoff (1868-1949), Amsterdam, 1901;{Note RMA.} his daughter, Emma van Hall, née Nijhoff (1905-90), Amsterdam;{Note RMA.} from the heirs of Paul Nijhoff (1868-1949), Amsterdam, fl. 125,000, to the museum, as a gift from the dealer R. Noortman, Maastricht, 1997",
